      "inputTokens": 47,
      "outputTokens": 359,
      "costUsd": 0.0032545,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's a way to remember the quicker formula. Mean of the squares, minus the square of the mean. Square the values, average them with the probabilities, and then subtract mu squared. The answer can never be negative."
